<section class="workflow-section reveal" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="section-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
    <h2>Scan, diagnose, plan, generate, approve, track, improve.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="workflow-grid">
    <article><span>01</span><h3>Scan your website</h3><p>Run a crawl and collect factual page evidence.</p></article>
    <article><span>02</span><h3>Diagnose SEO problems</h3><p>Identify technical, content, and search visibility issues.</p></article>
    <article><span>03</span><h3>Generate a 30-day plan</h3><p>Turn findings into a prioritized marketing roadmap.</p></article>
    <article><span>04</span><h3>Approve content improvements</h3><p>Review generated changes before anything is published.</p></article>
    <article><span>05</span><h3>Track performance</h3><p>Monitor search movement, clicks, impressions, and issue count.</p></article>
    <article><span>06</span><h3>Improve every week</h3><p>Repeat the loop with fresh evidence and smarter priorities.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

